  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.544,
      "end": 3.18,
      "text": "McDonald's put AI on the drive-thru speaker."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.699,
      "end": 5.222,
      "text": "Imagine asking for ice cream,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.493,
      "end": 8.393,
      "text": "and getting nine sweet teas, butter, and ketchup."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.043,
      "end": 10.16,
      "text": "The idea was smart."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.002,
      "end": 15.322,
      "text": "In 2021, McDonald's and IBM began testing voice ordering"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.394,
      "end": 16.813,
      "text": "at over a hundred locations."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.297,
      "end": 17.761,
      "text": "Speak."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.036,
      "end": 19.468,
      "text": "The AI understands."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.726,
      "end": 21.087,
      "text": "The order reaches the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.594,
      "end": 22.566,
      "text": "Faster service."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.821,
      "end": 23.841,
      "text": "Less manual work."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.396,
      "end": 25.84,
      "text": "But the AI went off script."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.434,
      "end": 29.389,
      "text": "One customer asked for a sweet tea; the system added nine."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.882,
      "end": 33.376,
      "text": "Another wanted water and vanilla ice cream, and got butter and ketchup."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.005,
      "end": 34.818,
      "text": "The clips spread."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.985,
      "end": 37.094,
      "text": "What was sold as the future"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.154,
      "end": 38.99,
      "text": "of fast food became a public reminder"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.063,
      "end": 42.173,
      "text": "that AI can fail in ordinary moments."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.07,
      "end": 48.679,
      "text": "In June 2024, McDonald's ended the current IBM order-taking test."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.243,
      "end": 50.847,
      "text": "But it didn't abandon voice AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.307,
      "end": 53.93,
      "text": "It said voice ordering could still be part of its future."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.657,
      "end": 57.186,
      "text": "The lesson isn't that AI is useless."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.747,
      "end": 61.679,
      "text": "Building AI is one thing; making it reliable is another."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.171,
      "end": 65.834,
      "text": "A better design confirms the order, knows when it's unsure,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.17,
      "end": 69.401,
      "text": "lets the customer correct it, and hands hard cases to a human."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.889,
      "end": 73.078,
      "text": "The smartest software isn't the one that does everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.286,
      "end": 75.36,
      "text": "It's the one that knows when to ask for help."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.926,
      "end": 78.966,
      "text": "For founders and developers, that's the opportunity."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.431,
      "end": 81.706,
      "text": "Don't build AI because it sounds impressive."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.958,
      "end": 83.603,
      "text": "Build something people can trust."
    }
  ]
}
